[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269532850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4269532850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4269532850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-e-ay","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T16:03:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T16:05:11Z","body":"This notably can only help with AIs that explore `contributing.md` autonomously, e.g. clawdbot (sometimes). It can't help as much if users are using a more integrated environment (e.g. Claude code or copilot, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118681 for that).\n\nWe will likely need a few orthogonal solutions to cover the majority. But i think this is worth a try.\n\nEdit: Also note that AIs might be made aware of these kinds of traps, so if it works, it will probably only work for a limited amount of time. We can always reconsider later.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269532850/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269548481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4269548481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4269548481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-fCPB","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T16:06:45Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T16:07:22Z","body":"As we were discussing in Rocket Chat, the issue of deceitful agents also exists. These will likely never get caught, regardless of the methods we employ. \r\nOne more idea that came up was to add something similar to the PR template, in case bots read that. Related: #118624 \r\n\r\nAny progress is valuable, though, as it will reduce the maintainers' workload. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269548481/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269822052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4269822052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4269822052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-gFBk","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T16:55:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T17:00:27Z","body":"The glama article is a fun read and clearly won some Internet points, but is there any evidence that a deceptive prompt injection trap is more effective than just adding an explicit requirement that agents should disclose themselves?\r\n\r\nThis will also occasionally be read by humans and [Poe's law](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poe%27s_law) never fails in my experience. I suspect a non-malicous agent would comply just as well with an actual guideline asking it to disclose itself in a format we request.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269822052/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269883868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4269883868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4269883868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-gUHc","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T17:06:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T17:06:11Z","body":"I don't think anyone has conducted A/B testing on prompt injection vs. explicit requirements for AI self-disclosure. I will try to look into it. \r\n\r\nI am completely open to trying an explicit requirement instead of what the article writer did. And if it turns out to be unsuccessful over a trial period, we can then switch to more aggressive methods, which may include this prompt-injection approach. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269883868/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4271324434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4271324434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4271324434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-lz0S","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T21:13:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T21:13:47Z","body":"What about adding the prompt to the file headers? Where the legal disclosure is. It's a blob of text humans ignore 99% percent of the time but AIs are forced to parse if they interact with code at all ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4271324434/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":4