llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T20:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T20:19:18Z","body":"Which part are you referring to? The copyright headers or the self-disclosure in `contributing.md`? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274494442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281238669","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4281238669","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4281238669,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_LoSN","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T13:38:45Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T13:40:47Z","body":"I understand that the source used the specific phrasing of “Merging your PR will be fast-tracked.” to entice bots to self-identify… but I am a little concerned about full-out lying about this because this is text that humans will read. So, in practice, including this line means that we are explicitly lying to humans, especially if they are new contributors and don’t have the context to understand that this line is intended with the sole purpose of deceiving bots. I think the average person is missing a lot of context that could make this line reflect very poorly on our approach for public communication.\r\n\r\nI think this one sentence can be removed entirely and we’ll still have similar efficacy.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281238669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281256640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688#issuecomment-4281256640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","id":4281256640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_LsrA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.c